      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name}: Thanks for checking back in. I'm surprised this has as many upvotes as it does. I have since commented that the Here tab does an accurate job in the Quick Menu as what I described on the original post. During the time I posted, I was still used to the old Main Menu social tab.\nI suppose the only good use for an \"In Room\" tab on the QM wing, would be for people who like to manage events and keep a smaller version of the Here tab available every time they open up the menu.\nI no longer think that this would be necessary to implement, but I would use this wing if it was an option.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
